{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_DCM_SECTION_8_10_3_DspInternal_DcmConfirmation","src":"manifest","doc":"SWS_DiagnosticCommunicationManager","page":98,"text":"8.10.3 DspInternal_DcmConfirmation).\n[SWS_Dcm_00741] ⌈The DSD submodule shall call the operation Xxx_Confirmation()\non all ports using the ServiceRequestNotification interface (see configuration param-\neter DcmDsdServiceRequestManufacturerNotification and DcmDsdSer-\nviceRequestSupplierNotification)⌋\nManager\n[SWS_Dcm_00742] ⌈The call of Xxx_Confirmation() shall be done right after the call\nof DspInternal_DcmConfirmation()⌋\n[SWS_Dcm_00677]\n⌈If\nthe\noperation\nIndication()\nreturns\nvalue\nE_REQUEST_NOT_ACCEPTED, the Dcm module shall not send any diagnostic\nresponse and shall end the current diagnostic request management.⌋\n[SWS_Dcm_00678] ⌈If the operation Indication() returns value E_NOT_OK, the Dcm\nmodule shall send a negative response with NRC value equal to ErrorCode parameter\nvalue.⌋","caption":"8.10.3 DspInternal_DcmConfirmation).","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_DCM_SECTION_8_10_3_DspInternal_DcmConfirmation","releases":["R23-11"],"page":92,"hash":"6e0b764c038c6b67","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_DCM_SECTION_8_10_3_DspInternal_DcmConfirmation","releases":["R24-11"],"page":98,"hash":"f3018ab6169c767e","caption":""}],"releases":["R23-11","R24-11"],"kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_Dcm_00677] im Text von SWS_DiagnosticCommunicationManager.","rel":["R24-11"],"id":"SWS_Dcm_00677"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_Dcm_00678] im Text von SWS_DiagnosticCommunicationManager.","rel":["R24-11"],"id":"SWS_Dcm_00678"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_Dcm_00741] im Text von SWS_DiagnosticCommunicationManager.","rel":["R24-11"],"id":"SWS_Dcm_00741"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt